0.492, "d": 0.488, "line": 28}, {"w": "a", "t": 61.19, "d": 0.117, "line": 29}, {"w": "souvenir", "t": 61.317, "d": 0.43, "line": 29}, {"w": "from", "t": 61.757, "d": 0.117, "line": 29}, {"w": "the", "t": 61.884, "d": 0.088, "line": 29}, {"w": "island", "t": 61.981, "d": 0.303, "line": 29}, {"w": "that", "t": 62.294, "d": 0.088, "line": 29}, {"w": "was", "t": 62.392, "d": 0.107, "line": 29}, {"w": "supposed", "t": 62.509, "d": 0.322, "line": 29}, {"w": "to", "t": 62.841, "d": 0.039, "line": 29}, {"w": "be", "t": 62.89, "d": 0.117, "line": 29}, {"w": "empty", "t": 63.017, "d": 0.303, "line": 29}], "lines": [{"i": 0, "text": "A Pearl Harbor pilot was told to crash on an empty island.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.712}, {"i": 1, "text": "A hundred and thirty-six people were standing on it.", "t0": 2.832, "t1": 4.963}, {"i": 2, "text": "His navy's plan for damaged planes: land on tiny Niihau, and wait for a submarine.", "t0": 5.083, "t1": 9.392}, {"i": 3, "text": "So he lands.", "t0": 9.512, "t1": 10.363}, {"i": 4, "text": "In a fence.", "t0": 10.483, "t1": 11.218}, {"i": 5, "text": "A local man pulls him out, and politely borrows his pistol and his papers.", "t0": 11.338, "t1": 14.611}, {"i": 6, "text": "The pilot asks for them back. No luck.", "t0": 14.731, "t1": 17.32}, {"i": 7, "text": "But nobody here knows there is a war.", "t0": 17.44, "t1": 19.142}, {"i": 8, "text": "So they throw their surprise guest a party.", "t0": 19.262, "t1": 21.041}, {"i": 9, "text": "That night, a battery radio delivers the news.", "t0": 21.161, "t1": 23.438}, {"i": 10, "text": "The party ends quickly.", "t0": 23.558, "t1": 24.654}, {"i": 11, "text": "Now he is a prisoner.", "t0": 24.774, "t1": 25.763}, {"i": 12, "text": "And no boat can come: the military has banned them all.", "t0": 25.883, "t1": 28.395}, {"i": 13, "text": "Then, five days later, he finds a helper with a shotgun.", "t0": 28.515, "t1": 31.437}, {"i": 14, "text": "They burn a house looking for the papers.", "t0": 31.557, "t1": 33.229}, {"i": 15, "text": "They burn the plane.", "t0": 33.349, "t1": 34.278}, {"i": 16, "text": "The village hides in caves.", "t0": 34.398, "t1": 35.709}, {"i": 17, "text": "One sheep rancher does not.", "t0": 35.829, "t1": 37.12}, {"i": 18, "text": "He is caught, with his wife, and he jumps the pilot.", "t0": 37.24, "t1": 39.801}, {"i": 19, "text": "The pilot shoots him three times.", "t0": 39.921, "t1": 41.554}, {"i": 20, "text": "As he told it later, that is when he got mad.", "t0": 41.674, "t1": 43.698}, {"i": 21, "text": "He picks the pilot up and throws him into a stone wall.", "t0": 43.818, "t1": 46.124}, {"i": 22, "text": "His wife ends the argument with a rock.", "t0": 46.244, "t1": 47.897}, {"i": 23, "text": "You see, Niihau was never empty. It was private.", "t0": 48.017, "t1": 51.377}, {"i": 24, "text": "One family owned it: no phones, no power, one boat a week.", "t0": 51.497, "t1": 54.693}, {"i": 25, "text": "A house with the curtains drawn.", "t0": 54.813, "t1": 56.241}, {"i": 26, "text": "The rancher got a medal.", "t0": 56.361, "t1": 57.466}, {"i": 27, "text": "The submarine never came.", "t0": 57.586, "t1": 58.858}, {"i": 28, "text": "And his plane is still in a Hawaii museum:", "t0": 58.978, "t1": 61.04}, {"i": 29, "text": "a souvenir from the island that was supposed to be empty.", "t0": 61.16, "t1": 63.379}]}